The '''PYRAMID30 Okaiken''' is a chart that ranks the best-performing singles in [[Okaiken]]. Its data, published by Nikkan Sports & Entertainment magazine, KTK Group and compiled by Okaiken Pyramid Records, is based collectively on each single's weekly physical and digital sales, as well as radio airplay and streaming. PYRAMID30 Okaiken is a subsidiary of Pyramid Records but acts as a separate organization. The weekly charts are updated every Sunday at 11:45 in the morning (UTC +9). The following lists all of the number one singles of the PYRAMID30 Okaiken for 2022.

2022 is remembered as the "Year of the Parma Invasion" in Okaiken. While domestic pop and anime themes performed strongly, the charts were radically disrupted by the viral explosion of "Parma Drill". The track "SEVEN 7oo," initially an underground favorite, became a nationwide phenomenon, sparking a cultural exchange that saw Sanese drill artists like [[Ralph (rapper)|Ralph]] and [[Watson (rapper)|Watson]] adopting European flows. This massive shift coincided with the continued dominance of [[Ado (singer)|Ado]] following her work on ''One Piece Film: Red''.

